{"ticker":{"symbol":"476060.KQ","name":"온코닉테라퓨틱스","market":"KR","exchange":""},"currency":"KRW","price":12570.0,"change_pct":0.02195121951219514,"market_cap":570776551424.0,"pe":null,"pb":null,"dividend_yield":null,"week52_low":8790.0,"week52_high":28900.0,"sector":"Healthcare","industry":"Drug Manufacturers - Specialty & Generic","country":"South Korea","city":"Seoul","employees":null,"website":"https://onconic.co.kr","business_summary":"Onconic Therapeutics Inc. engages in the research and development of anti-cancer therapy in South Korea. It develops Zastaprazan (OCN-101), a potassium-competitive acid blocker, which is in phase 3 for the treatment of gastric acid related disease; and OCN-201 (JPI-547), an anticancer drug; JP-1366, a treatment for peptic ulcer; and drugs for DDR and immuno-oncology fields. JP-1366, a poly ADP-ribose polymerase inhibitor, which is in phase 1 for the treatment of pancreatic cancer. The company was founded in 2020 and is based in Seoul, South Korea.","business_summary_ko":"온코닉 테라퓨틱스(Onconic Therapeutics Inc.)는 한국에서 항암치료제의 연구개발에 참여하고 있습니다. 칼륨 경쟁적 위산분비 차단제 '자스타프라잔(OCN-101)'을 개발해 위산 관련 질환 치료를 위한 임상 3상을 진행 중이다. 및 항암제인 OCN-201(JPI-547); 소화성 궤양 치료제인 JP-1366; DDR 및 면역종양학 분야의 약물. 폴리 ADP-리보스 중합효소 억제제 JP-1366은 췌장암 치료제로 임상 1상을 진행 중이다. 이 회사는 2020년에 설립되었으며 대한민국 서울에 본사를 두고 있습니다.","desc_ko":"","estimates":[{"period":"2026","rev":0.0,"rev_lo":0.0,"rev_hi":0.0,"rev_g":null},{"period":"2027","rev":0.0,"rev_lo":0.0,"rev_hi":0.0,"rev_g":null}],"ltg":null,"calendar":{},"industry_ko":"제약 (스페셜티·제네릭)","financials":[{"period":"2022","revenue":95000000.0,"operating_income":-14837552000.0,"net_income":-14431902780.0,"eps":-6242.25},{"period":"2023","revenue":21056033490.0,"operating_income":2230939490.0,"net_income":1682463190.0,"eps":72.75},{"period":"2024","revenue":14838322420.0,"operating_income":-4797790580.0,"net_income":-8092612260.0,"eps":-61.75},{"period":"2025","revenue":53391845890.0,"operating_income":12619100890.0,"net_income":15783991460.0,"eps":